    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present 34 Ropewalk Place, Ringsend, Dublin 4 to the market. This own-door spacious one bedroom apartment comes to the market in absolute turnkey condition, leaving the lucky new owners nothing to but unpack. Ideal for First Time Buyers and Investors alike. The bright and spacious accommodation extends to 43 sqm / 462 sqft and briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, open plan kitchen / living / dining room, a large double bedroom and a bathroom completes the accommodation. The apartment further benefits from an underground designated parking space. \n\nRingsend is a charming village with great parks and sports facilities, many restaurants, shops and pubs and is in close proximity to the vibrant Docklands area, the IFSC, Google, Meta, Linked-In, 3 Arena, Bord Gais Energy Theatre, Aviva Stadium and just a 20-minute walk to the City Centre. The village is served with excellent public transport comprising Bus, Red Line Luas and DART as well as Dublin Bike scheme. Ringsend is less than 20 minutes from Dublin Airport via the Port Tunnel. Sandymount Strand and nature reserve are also within a short walk."
      },
      {
